OL,3,GNEWSA'The school has gone': The cries
OL,4,Aheard by man who called 999 as Aberfan
OL,5,Adisaster unfolded
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It was the saddest day of my life,"
OL,8,Fthe 86-year-old said. "There will never
OL,9,Fbe a day equal to that. Never, ever."
